check 1
# Act II waypoint on level 52 (object 288): warp, operate (0x13 type 2), open menu; take the waypoint to level 40 (0x49).
name a2-wp-52
save ScnAm2 --class ama --expansion --act 1 --quests acts=1 --waypoints all
seed 1234
ticks 50
seconds 600
channels state packets
at 4 poke warp 52
at 8 poke goto unit 2:288
at 24 send InteractWithEntity type=2 id=@2:288
at 30 send TakeOrCloseWp wp=@2:288 level=40
